1
00:00:10,059 --> 00:00:11,686
I’m sorry.

2
00:00:13,042 --> 00:00:14,705
I’m sorry.

3
00:00:17,442 --> 00:00:19,937
I shouldn’t have come back.

4
00:02:09,079 --> 00:02:09,842
Aunt Niam.

5
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:12,670
Good morning, Miss.

6
00:02:12,670 --> 00:02:17,259
I brought a lot of delicious food for you.

7
00:02:17,629 --> 00:02:19,019
Let me help you.

8
00:02:19,019 --> 00:02:20,865
Yes, take this

9
00:02:20,865 --> 00:02:22,814
Let me take off my shoes first.

10
00:02:27,054 --> 00:02:29,516
Did Dad and Big Mom tell you
to bring it to me?

11
00:02:30,773 --> 00:02:33,442
No one told me to do this.

12
00:02:33,442 --> 00:02:37,529
I made your favorite food.

13
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:42,443
So I want to give it to you.

14
00:02:45,697 --> 00:02:47,862
Next time,
you can have someone deliver it to me.

15
00:02:47,862 --> 00:02:49,228
How can I do that?

16
00:02:49,499 --> 00:02:51,664
I made the food.

17
00:02:51,664 --> 00:02:54,862
I need to deliver it myself.

18
00:02:56,193 --> 00:02:57,692
Do as you please.

19
00:02:57,865 --> 00:02:59,225
Thank you.

20
00:02:59,324 --> 00:03:00,361
You’re welcome.

21
00:03:00,361 --> 00:03:02,699
I’ll put it in the refrigerator.

22
00:03:10,858 --> 00:03:11,798
Simba.

23
00:03:12,907 --> 00:03:13,584
Come here.

24
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,509
Say hi to Aunt Niam.

25
00:03:19,183 --> 00:03:20,545
Look.

26
00:03:25,205 --> 00:03:27,964
Aunt Niam, you’re doing it again.

27
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:30,976
I hire a helper to clean my condo every week.

28
00:03:31,173 --> 00:03:32,469
I can’t help it.

29
00:03:32,962 --> 00:03:34,351
This is your condo.

30
00:03:34,351 --> 00:03:37,507
I have to…

31
00:03:37,507 --> 00:03:39,993
…clean it yourself.

32
00:03:40,634 --> 00:03:42,495
Yes, Miss.

33
00:03:46,019 --> 00:03:47,832
I almost forgot.

34
00:03:48,744 --> 00:03:52,961
Madam bought cat treats for Simba.

35
00:03:53,257 --> 00:03:55,865
They are in the brown bag.

36
00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:58,864
I almost forgot it.

37
00:03:58,864 --> 00:03:59,564
Thank you.

38
00:03:59,564 --> 00:04:00,633
Alright.

39
00:04:00,855 --> 00:04:03,486
She must really miss Simba.

40
00:04:05,162 --> 00:04:08,673
Simba is such a cuddly cat.

41
00:04:08,969 --> 00:04:11,062
Who would not fall for it?

42
00:04:12,344 --> 00:04:16,702
How is she doing?

43
00:04:17,244 --> 00:04:18,608
Madam?

44
00:04:19,150 --> 00:04:23,496
She is losing her appetite.

45
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,442
She barely eats.

46
00:04:25,615 --> 00:04:28,163
She also gets sick often.

47
00:04:30,678 --> 00:04:34,236
Dad is probably busy with the farm, right?

48
00:04:43,971 --> 00:04:44,970
Miss Key.

49
00:04:47,016 --> 00:04:51,299
Can’t you find time to visit her?

50
00:04:52,433 --> 00:04:54,707
Although she’s not your biological mom,

51
00:04:54,707 --> 00:05:00,673
she loves you as if you were her daughter.

52
00:05:06,738 --> 00:05:08,802
I can’t go back to that house.

53
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,236
No.

54
00:05:13,236 --> 00:05:14,698
Don’t think that.

55
00:05:15,388 --> 00:05:17,814
It happened a long time ago.

56
00:05:19,121 --> 00:05:24,063
It was not your fault.

57
00:05:27,391 --> 00:05:28,623
It was my fault.

58
00:05:29,708 --> 00:05:30,928
It was surely my fault.

59
00:05:44,798 --> 00:05:46,235
Stop blaming yourself.

60
00:06:16,297 --> 00:06:18,751
(Why are you crying?)

61
00:06:53,181 --> 00:06:54,660
Shit.

62
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,129
Chan.

63
00:07:03,383 --> 00:07:04,332
I’m sorry.

64
00:07:04,874 --> 00:07:06,279
I’ll call the insurance company.

65
00:07:07,561 --> 00:07:09,508
It’s okay. It’s just a small scratch.

66
00:07:10,149 --> 00:07:11,052
No.

67
00:07:11,348 --> 00:07:12,291
Let’s call the insurance company.

68
00:07:12,464 --> 00:07:13,522
I hit your car.

69
00:07:14,064 --> 00:07:15,279
I need to take responsibility.

70
00:07:15,772 --> 00:07:16,989
After talking to the insurance,

71
00:07:16,989 --> 00:07:18,123
I’ll buy you lunch.

72
00:07:19,874 --> 00:07:22,094
Did you intentionally hit my car?

73
00:07:23,450 --> 00:07:24,383
No way.

74
00:07:24,975 --> 00:07:26,401
Why would I do that?

75
00:07:28,472 --> 00:07:29,692
What are you doing here?

76
00:07:30,308 --> 00:07:32,047
I have a practice with my band.

77
00:07:32,787 --> 00:07:34,406
I didn’t mean to hit your car.

78
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:35,558
Really?

79
00:07:36,717 --> 00:07:38,762
You always try to get my attention.

80
00:07:42,805 --> 00:07:43,809
That’s true.

81
00:07:44,795 --> 00:07:46,144
I admit it.

82
00:07:46,908 --> 00:07:48,512
I want you to pay attention to me.

83
00:07:48,734 --> 00:07:50,357
But not like this.

84
00:07:52,477 --> 00:07:53,488
You should go.

85
00:07:54,178 --> 00:07:55,367
You don’t need to take responsibility for it.

86
00:07:57,438 --> 00:07:58,361
Wait.

87
00:07:59,495 --> 00:08:01,286
Since we ran into each other,

88
00:08:01,705 --> 00:08:04,452
why don’t you let me buy you lunch?

89
00:08:06,252 --> 00:08:07,531
As an apology.

90
00:08:07,531 --> 00:08:10,478
No, I don’t need anyone to buy me lunch.

91
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,432
Then can you buy me lunch?

92
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,773
Please.

93
00:08:17,365 --> 00:08:18,040
Please.

94
00:08:28,401 --> 00:08:30,282
Aren’t you going to eat that?

95
00:08:31,983 --> 00:08:33,244
Yes.

96
00:08:34,156 --> 00:08:36,125
But it would be nice
if I could have something else too.

97
00:08:36,125 --> 00:08:39,086
All you think of is that?

98
00:08:39,086 --> 00:08:40,650
All I think of…

99
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,722
…is you

100
00:08:43,856 --> 00:08:45,199
Can you be serious?

101
00:08:46,604 --> 00:08:47,825
I’ll be serious.

102
00:08:48,836 --> 00:08:49,941
So…

103
00:08:51,198 --> 00:08:52,620
did you think about my offer?

104
00:08:54,839 --> 00:08:56,871
Are you interested in having me
as your sugar baby?

105
00:08:58,202 --> 00:08:59,380
Are you sure you’re being serious?

106
00:08:59,553 --> 00:09:01,197
I’m absolutely serious about it.

107
00:09:01,912 --> 00:09:02,976
So?

108
00:09:04,406 --> 00:09:05,714
Are you interested?

109
00:09:08,032 --> 00:09:09,244
I’m a businesswoman.

110
00:09:09,663 --> 00:09:13,251
I don’t make a deal that doesn’t benefit me.

111
00:09:18,576 --> 00:09:19,914
Then what do you want?

112
00:09:21,492 --> 00:09:22,661
I can give you everything.

113
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:27,203
I’d do anything for you.

114
00:09:28,756 --> 00:09:29,926
I’ll give in to you in everything.

115
00:09:30,814 --> 00:09:31,808
Just tell me.

116
00:09:33,583 --> 00:09:35,490
A player like you,

117
00:09:36,575 --> 00:09:38,783
how many times
have you made this kind of offer?

118
00:09:39,769 --> 00:09:41,363
You are the first

119
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:43,822
and only one.

120
00:09:44,241 --> 00:09:44,867
Really?

121
00:09:45,730 --> 00:09:46,977
What about your other girls?

122
00:09:47,569 --> 00:09:48,853
You seem to have many girls around you.

123
00:09:52,674 --> 00:09:54,005
Don’t worry.

124
00:09:55,213 --> 00:09:56,616
If you take me,

125
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:59,731
I’ll cut them off.

126
00:10:00,545 --> 00:10:01,907
I’ll leave everything behind.

127
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:05,200
You will have all of me.

128
00:10:06,112 --> 00:10:09,869
And I will have only you.

129
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,663
Why do I have to do that?

130
00:10:14,255 --> 00:10:17,653
I can spend money
on something more useful.

131
00:10:22,510 --> 00:10:26,362
Because we are a good match.

132
00:10:29,518 --> 00:10:30,735
That night,

133
00:10:32,165 --> 00:10:33,559
I fell for you.

134
00:10:35,334 --> 00:10:40,456
You seem to be pretty into me too.

135
00:10:44,661 --> 00:10:48,504
You haven’t told me
why you got the moon tattoo.

136
00:10:53,558 --> 00:10:54,728
How about this?

137
00:10:56,207 --> 00:10:59,461
After finishing lunch, you go to my condo.

138
00:11:00,472 --> 00:11:02,192
I’ll tell you everything.

139
00:11:03,548 --> 00:11:04,693
Tell me now.

140
00:11:05,605 --> 00:11:07,781
I have a cat at home.

141
00:11:09,926 --> 00:11:11,127
Don’t you want to see him?

142
00:11:12,310 --> 00:11:14,068
He’s very cute.

143
00:11:18,555 --> 00:11:21,440
You can hold him, rub his belly,

144
00:11:22,821 --> 00:11:23,907
and even kiss him.

145
00:11:28,222 --> 00:11:29,241
Come in.

146
00:11:41,417 --> 00:11:42,702
Here are the slippers.

147
00:11:59,408 --> 00:12:00,264
Simba.

148
00:12:05,540 --> 00:12:06,596
You can hold him.

149
00:12:06,596 --> 00:12:08,159
He won’t bite or scratch you.

150
00:12:08,751 --> 00:12:10,048
He’s nice just like his owner.

151
00:12:10,369 --> 00:12:11,490
It’s okay.

152
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,399
I’ve never held a cat before.

153
00:12:13,818 --> 00:12:14,777
I don’t know how to do it.

154
00:12:15,591 --> 00:12:19,201
If you are afraid, you can just pat him.

155
00:12:29,858 --> 00:12:31,483
Look, who is this?

156
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,900
Like this.

157
00:12:39,193 --> 00:12:40,115
See?

158
00:12:42,901 --> 00:12:44,125
He’s cute.

159
00:12:49,796 --> 00:12:53,553
I never thought I would be patting a cat.

160
00:12:56,388 --> 00:12:57,736
You already fell for him.

161
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,433
I guess so.

162
00:13:03,046 --> 00:13:04,877
You are cuddling her.

163
00:13:26,478 --> 00:13:28,419
You don’t seem to have a money problem.

164
00:13:29,701 --> 00:13:31,436
Why do you want to be my sugar baby?

165
00:13:37,871 --> 00:13:39,518
I don’t have any money problems.

166
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,117
I just want to be your girl.

167
00:13:47,590 --> 00:13:49,392
Stop being cryptic.

168
00:13:50,995 --> 00:13:52,415
What exactly do you want from me?

169
00:14:01,236 --> 00:14:03,543
Everything is related to this tattoo.

170
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,234
Who are you?

171
00:14:32,035 --> 00:14:33,698
What did Key say, Niam?

172
00:14:36,706 --> 00:14:37,933
I failed.

173
00:14:39,659 --> 00:14:41,335
She refuses to come home.

174
00:14:42,271 --> 00:14:44,154
Even though she knows you’re sick.

175
00:14:45,633 --> 00:14:48,727
It’s not about that.

176
00:14:49,097 --> 00:14:54,858
I think she still can’t forgive herself about Pin.

177
00:15:01,244 --> 00:15:05,283
This will haunt our family forever.

178
00:15:07,847 --> 00:15:09,698
I feel sorry for Key

179
00:15:10,092 --> 00:15:12,408
for what she’s going through.

180
00:15:17,018 --> 00:15:18,791
Kiran Mahattanakit.

181
00:15:19,161 --> 00:15:23,204
Your last name is Mahattanakit,
but you work as a singer at my bar?

182
00:15:28,208 --> 00:15:32,642
I want to be close
to the person who saved my life.

183
00:15:38,806 --> 00:15:41,595
The person who is my first love.

184
00:15:43,666 --> 00:15:44,677
Hold on.

185
00:15:46,403 --> 00:15:48,004
Have we met before?

186
00:15:53,428 --> 00:15:58,036
I won’t tell you if we have met.

187
00:16:02,289 --> 00:16:03,913
You have to remember it yourself.

188
00:16:21,783 --> 00:16:23,411
But I can tell you this.

189
00:16:25,876 --> 00:16:27,917
I chose to get the moon tattoo
because of you.

190
00:16:30,604 --> 00:16:32,319
You are my first love.

191
00:16:52,700 --> 00:16:54,657
As long as I can be with you,

192
00:16:58,014 --> 00:16:59,604
it doesn’t matter what I am to you.

193
00:17:02,390 --> 00:17:03,635
I’ll accept it.

194
00:17:36,736 --> 00:17:38,966
Why do you want to be my sugar baby?

195
00:17:38,966 --> 00:17:40,214
It seems fun.

196
00:17:40,214 --> 00:17:40,714
Meow.

197
00:17:40,714 --> 00:17:44,504
So she and you are not just a one-night stand anymore.

198
00:17:44,504 --> 00:17:45,609
I have a new rule.

199
00:17:45,609 --> 00:17:48,381
The two of us will not kiss.

200
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,294
What song is this?

201
00:17:51,294 --> 00:17:52,853
It’s a song that I wrote.

202
00:17:53,223 --> 00:17:54,214
It sounds great.

203
00:17:54,633 --> 00:17:55,646
Sing it again.

204
00:17:56,238 --> 00:17:57,992
You don’t need to pretend, Jay.

205
00:17:58,140 --> 00:17:59,635
I know you hate me.

206
00:17:59,852 --> 00:18:01,597
I just want to take what is mine back.

207
00:18:04,679 --> 00:18:06,807
You have no right to touch my stuff,

208
00:18:06,807 --> 00:18:08,382
especially this piano.

209
00:18:09,142 --> 00:18:10,252
Hi.

210
00:18:10,844 --> 00:18:12,242
Do you miss me?

